        "created_at": "2014-02-02T15:39:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Proletariat would proabably be the easiest to turn into a full villain deck, even if we just left him short (20 cards I believe) and just gave him a character card with new rules.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fright Train I imagine would need scaling, and that would be harder to do (maybe)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The real issue is how they interact with the other vengeance villain decks. &nbsp;I assume they do, so that would eliminate a number of their cards as viable for a single villain deck.</p>",
